},{"id":"plan-template-plan-risk","type":"plan-risk","label":"Risk","root":false,"position":{"x":250,"y":650},"width":380,"height":260,"color":"#e11d48","ports":[{"id":"root","key":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":180}],"handles":[{"id":"root","key":"root","portId":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Risk","description":"Something that may derail or degrade the plan.","status":"draft","notes":"","definitionKey":"plan-risk","_classBinding":{"key":"plan-risk","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/plan-template/classes/nodes/plan-risk.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"plan-risk","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/plan-template/classes/nodes/plan-risk.node-class.node"},"presentation":{"glyph":{"kind":"icon","name":"TriangleAlert"}}}},{"id":"plan-template-plan-contingency","type":"plan-contingency","label":"Contingency","root":false,"position":{"x":250,"y":950},"width":380,"height":260,"color":"#7c3aed","ports":[{"id":"root","key":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":180}],"handles":[{"id":"root","key":"root","portId":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Contingency","description":"A prepared response to an adverse condition or outcome.","status":"draft","notes":"","definitionKey":"plan-contingency","_classBinding":{"key":"plan-contingency","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/plan-template/classes/nodes/plan-contingency.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"plan-contingency","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/plan-template/classes/nodes/plan-contingency.node-class.node"},"presentation":{"glyph":{"kind":"icon","name":"ShieldCheck"}}}},{"id":"plan-template-instructions","type":"markdown","label":"Using This Template","root":false,"position":{"x":-700,"y":1050},"width":760,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","key":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":180}],"handles":[{"id":"root","key":"root","portId":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"plan-template-declaration"},"markdown":"## Use the graph as a path\n\nKeep **Plan** and the primary **Goal** as anchors. Duplicate **Phase**, **Action**, **Milestone**, **Decision**, **Constraint**, **Risk**, and **Contingency** as the plan grows.\n\nPlans coordinate work; tasks decompose work. Promote an Action into a dedicated Task graph when execution detail deserves its own artifact.\n\nColor is semantic: blue-family nodes describe the path, green marks outcomes, amber marks forks, rose marks threats, slate marks limits, and violet marks fallback responses.\n\nSee the adjacent `SKILL.md` before deriving a new graph."}}],"edges":[{"id":"template-default","type":"default-view","source":"plan-template-declaration","target":"plan-template-detail-view","sourceHandle":"default-view","targetHandle":"root"},{"id":"template-summary","type":"reference","source":"plan-template-declaration","target":"plan-template-summary-view","sourceHandle":"summary-view","targetHandle":"root"},{"id":"template-icon","type":"reference","source":"plan-template-declaration","target":"plan-template-icon-view","sourceHandle":"icon-view","targetHandle":"root"},{"id":"template-glyph","type":"reference","source":"plan-template-declaration","target":"plan-template-glyph","sourceHandle":"glyph","targetHandle":"root"},{"id":"template-port","type":"reference","source":"plan-template-declaration","target":"plan-template-root-port","sourceHandle":"port","targetHandle":"root"},{"id":"template-landing","type":"reference","source":"plan-template-declaration","target":"plan-template-landing-content","sourceHandle":"landing-surface","targetHandle":"ro